<article>
    <h2> What is Diamond Painting? </h2>
	<br>
    <p> Diamond painting is almost like a mix of bedazzling and paint by number. You have a canvas or other surface with a design and bags of tiny gems with numbers that match a legend almost, like you would have for paint by number projects.</p>
    <p> There are different tools that you can use for diamond painting. Most kits come with a pen that allows you to place one gem at a time, but that is not your only option. You can get longer attachments for the pen, or a roller for larger parts of the project. You can even get pens that have a light on them to make it easier to see what you're doing. </p>
    <p> There's a vast amount of places to get these kits from, I will have some of my favorites listed in the tips. You can get all kind of kits from holidays or seasons to movies, animals, even your favorite singers sometimes.</p>
</article>
